    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Developer Overview – FOI Initialize Data Tables\n\n**Purpose:**\nSetup utility that makes sure the three n8n data tables used by the FOI workflows exist: `foi-process-audit` (audit trail written by every FOI workflow) `foi-payment-sla` (tracks active online payments and their expiry) and `foi-execution-errors` (one row per failed execution, written by FOI Error Handler).\n\n**Trigger/Entry:**\nManual (\"Execute workflow\"). Run once per environment before enabling the FOI workflows. Safe to re-run.\n\n**Processing:**\nLists the existing data tables, checks for each required table, creates any that are missing with the expected columns, and marks existing ones as skipped.\n\n**Integration/Outcome:**\nn8n Data Tables only. Returns a summary (`status`, `ranAt`, and each table with action `created` or `skipped-already-exists`).",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "35d365fa-91f3-4b0e-a316-cfe2d9743bb2",
      "name": "Developer Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
